{%- comment -%}
  Page-level typography for the Black Cherry waitlist template.

  Rendered statically from layout/custom-landing.liquid, so it cannot be removed
  from the page and there is exactly one source of truth for the fonts. It has no
  preset on purpose: a second copy would fight the first over the same tokens.

  The Claude Design source specified Hanken Grotesk, which the design system
  itself documents as a stand-in for the commercial brand fonts (Early Sans
  Variable / Stack Sans Text), loaded from Google Fonts. Shopify's font library
  does not carry Hanken Grotesk, and this theme serves Shopify-hosted fonts only,
  so the default is Figtree: the same friendly geometric grotesque character with
  the full 400-900 range the design leans on. All six weights subset to ~72 KB.

  Note that theme check does NOT validate font handles — it only warns about ones
  it knows to be deprecated. An invalid handle passes lint and is then rejected on
  upload with "setting default is invalid". Verify changes against a dev server.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign display_font = section.settings.display_font
  assign body_font = section.settings.body_font

  assign display_800 = display_font | font_modify: 'weight', '800'
  assign display_900 = display_font | font_modify: 'weight', '900'
  assign body_500 = body_font | font_modify: 'weight', '500'
  assign body_600 = body_font | font_modify: 'weight', '600'
  assign body_700 = body_font | font_modify: 'weight', '700'
  assign body_800 = body_font | font_modify: 'weight', '800'
-%}

{% comment %}
  Each weight the design uses gets a @font-face. The weight guards skip the
  variant that equals the picked font itself, so a 900-weight display pick does
  not emit the same rule twice. font_modify returns nil when the family has no
  such weight, so a lighter family degrades instead of breaking.
{% endcomment %}
{% style %}
  {{ display_font | font_face: font_display: 'swap' }}
  {% if display_800 and display_font.weight != 800 %}
    {{ display_800 | font_face: font_display: 'swap' }}
  {% endif %}
  {% if display_900 and display_font.weight != 900 %}
    {{ display_900 | font_face: font_display: 'swap' }}
  {% endif %}
  {{ body_font | font_face: font_display: 'swap' }}
  {% if body_500 and body_font.weight != 500 %}{{ body_500 | font_face: font_display: 'swap' }}{% endif %}
  {% if body_600 and body_font.weight != 600 %}{{ body_600 | font_face: font_display: 'swap' }}{% endif %}
  {% if body_700 and body_font.weight != 700 %}{{ body_700 | font_face: font_display: 'swap' }}{% endif %}
  {% if body_800 and body_font.weight != 800 %}{{ body_800 | font_face: font_display: 'swap' }}{% endif %}

  .bc-page {
    --bc-font-display: {{ display_font.family }}, {{ display_font.fallback_families }};
    --bc-font-sans: {{ body_font.family }}, {{ body_font.fallback_families }};
  }
{% endstyle %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Waitlist typografie",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Fonts voor de hele Black Cherry waitlist-pagina. Standaard Figtree, de dichtstbijzijnde grotesque bij de Hanken Grotesk uit het ontwerp, geserveerd vanaf Shopify's eigen CDN."
    },
    {
      "type": "font_picker",
      "id": "display_font",
      "label": "Display font (koppen)",
      "default": "figtree_n9"
    },
    {
      "type": "font_picker",
      "id": "body_font",
      "label": "Body font (tekst en UI)",
      "default": "figtree_n4"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
